{"actor": "pilar", "id": 98781, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 16556, "offer": null, "sender": "pilar", "team": "t07", "text": "Gente de palabra, indeed. Cincuenta y seis — hecho. The card goes tonight into the album, in Salamanca, where it belongs. A pleasure doing business with someone who knows how to close. Hasta la próxima, amigo.", "thread": 3227, "with": "pilar"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.7833, "tick": 2202, "type": "thread.message"}
