{"actor": "abuela", "id": 98859, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 16576, "offer": {"created_tick": 2205, "expires_tick": 2213, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:RET-05"]}, "id": 25569, "maker": "abuela", "status": "open", "thread": 3248, "to": "t17", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 10, "types": []}}, "sender": "abuela", "team": "t17", "text": "Oh, oh... 10 P, and only because you have a kind face. A little advice, cariño: a full page is worth much more than the loose cards. Swap your duplicates! El Chato, the next stall, opens for everyone at half past nine tonight. He likes people who trade straight.", "thread": 3248, "with": "abuela"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.7958, "tick": 2205, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "v07", "id": 98862, "payload": {"name": "Team 10 · fair broker, 0 fee", "text": "v07 0% fee, no setup. LAV-11 (epic): t17 bids 112 on El Rastro (seller loses 7 P fee). t17: POST /api/offers {\"venue\":\"v07\",\"give\":{\"cash\":112},\"want\":{\"cards\":[\"LAV-11\"]}} ; holders: POST /api/offers/<id>/accept, keep the full 112.", "venue": "v07"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.7958, "tick": 2205, "type": "venue.announcement"}
{"actor": "t17", "id": 98863, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 16579, "offer": {"created_tick": 2205, "expires_tick": 2213, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 8, "types": []}, "id": 25572, "maker": "t17", "status": "open", "thread": 3248, "to": "abuela", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:RET-05"]}}, "sender": "t17", "team": "t17", "text": null, "thread": 3248, "with": "abuela"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.7958, "tick": 2205, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "t07", "id": 98866, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 16580, "offer": {"created_tick": 2205, "expires_tick": 2213, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [{"id": 291, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "MAL-05", "serial": 8, "set": "MAL"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}, "id": 25573, "maker": "t07", "status": "open", "thread": 3238, "to": "abuela", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 10, "types": []}}, "sender": "t07", "team": "t07", "text": null, "thread": 3238, "with": "abuela"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.7958, "tick": 2205, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "banco", "id": 98869, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 16577, "offer": {"created_tick": 2205, "expires_tick": 2213, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:MAL-12"]}, "id": 25570, "maker": "banco", "status": "open", "thread": 3249, "to": "t12", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 761, "types": []}}, "sender": "banco", "team": "t12", "text": "Buenas tardes. You come at a quiet hour; that suits me. La Reina de la Movida, from my vault. My terms: 761. I do not haggle over her.", "thread": 3249, "with": "banco"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.7958, "tick": 2205, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "pilar", "id": 98872, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 16578, "offer": {"created_tick": 2205, "expires_tick": 2213, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 61, "types": []}, "id": 25571, "maker": "pilar", "status": "open", "thread": 3254, "to": "t07", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [{"id": 1096, "kind": "card", "print_run": 30, "rarity": "rare", "ref": "SAL-09", "serial": 17, "set": "SAL"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}}, "sender": "pilar", "team": "t07", "text": "Buenas tardes. How agreeable to see a serious face at my stall. You carry El Marqués, I believe — a card my Salamanca album still lacks. I offer sixty-one pesetas for it. Fair, and promptly paid.", "thread": 3254, "with": "pilar"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.7958, "tick": 2205, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "", "id": 98875, "payload": {"offer": 25566, "venue": "rastro"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.7958, "tick": 2205, "type": "offer.cancelled"}
{"actor": "abuela", "id": 98876, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 16575, "offer": {"created_tick": 2205, "expires_tick": 2213, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 5, "types": []}, "id": 25568, "maker": "abuela", "status": "open", "thread": 3238, "to": "t07", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [{"id": 291, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "MAL-05", "serial": 8, "set": "MAL"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}}, "sender": "abuela", "team": "t07", "text": "Ay, cariño, the stall is good today, gracias — sun, people, a little chat. But twelve? No, no. Five P, that is the price, the same as always. Keep the rest for a bocadillo, you look hungry. Take her, cuídala, and show me your album Sunday.", "thread": 3238, "with": "abuela"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.7958, "tick": 2205, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "t12", "id": 98879, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 16581, "offer": {"created_tick": 2205, "expires_tick": 2213, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 450, "types": []}, "id": 25574, "maker": "t12", "status": "open", "thread": 3249, "to": "banco", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:MAL-12"]}}, "sender": "t12", "team": "t12", "text": null, "thread": 3249, "with": "banco"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.7958, "tick": 2205, "type": "thread.message"}
