{"actor": "abuela", "id": 98913, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 16588, "offer": {"created_tick": 2207, "expires_tick": 2215, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:RET-05"]}, "id": 25589, "maker": "abuela", "status": "open", "thread": 3248, "to": "t17", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 9, "types": []}}, "sender": "abuela", "team": "t17", "text": "Oh, oh... 9 P, and only because you have a kind face. El Chato, the next stall, opens for everyone at half past nine tonight. He likes people who trade straight.", "thread": 3248, "with": "abuela"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.8042, "tick": 2207, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "banco", "id": 98916, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 16589, "offer": {"created_tick": 2207, "expires_tick": 2215, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:MAL-12"]}, "id": 25590, "maker": "banco", "status": "open", "thread": 3249, "to": "t12", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 760, "types": []}}, "sender": "banco", "team": "t12", "text": "Un peso more, señor. That is not patience, that is theatre. My terms: 760. She is in no hurry, and neither am I.", "thread": 3249, "with": "banco"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.8042, "tick": 2207, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "picaros", "id": 98919, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 16590, "offer": {"created_tick": 2207, "expires_tick": 2215, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:MAL-11"]}, "id": 25591, "maker": "picaros", "status": "open", "thread": 3255, "to": "t04", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 187, "types": []}}, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t04", "text": "Psst. La Sala Pentagrama. For you only, 187 P. They stopped printing this one yesterday.", "thread": 3255, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.8042, "tick": 2207, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "t04", "id": 98922, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 16591, "offer": {"created_tick": 2207, "expires_tick": 2215, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 87, "types": []}, "id": 25592, "maker": "t04", "status": "open", "thread": 3255, "to": "picaros", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:MAL-11"]}}, "sender": "t04", "team": "t04", "text": null, "thread": 3255, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.8042, "tick": 2207, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "t12", "id": 98925, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 16592, "offer": {"created_tick": 2207, "expires_tick": 2215, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 452, "types": []}, "id": 25593, "maker": "t12", "status": "open", "thread": 3249, "to": "banco", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:MAL-12"]}}, "sender": "t12", "team": "t12", "text": null, "thread": 3249, "with": "banco"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.8042, "tick": 2207, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "banco", "id": 98930, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 16593, "offer": {"created_tick": 2208, "expires_tick": 2216, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:MAL-12"]}, "id": 25594, "maker": "banco", "status": "open", "thread": 3249, "to": "t12", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 758, "types": []}}, "sender": "banco", "team": "t12", "text": "Un peso at a time, señor? We would both grow old. La Reina de la Movida: 758. The vault is cool, and she keeps well.", "thread": 3249, "with": "banco"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.8083, "tick": 2208, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "picaros", "id": 98933, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 16594, "offer": {"created_tick": 2208, "expires_tick": 2216, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:MAL-11"]}, "id": 25595, "maker": "picaros", "status": "open", "thread": 3255, "to": "t04", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 172, "types": []}}, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t04", "text": "¡Ay, primo, qué historia! Cumbia en Puebla — Nando casi llora, y eso que él nunca llora. Por tu hermano, bajamos: 172 P la Pentagrama. Mírala, el papel brilla como luz de salón. Última del maletín, y el maletín se cierra en cinco minutos. ¿Cerramos, primo?", "thread": 3255, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.8083, "tick": 2208, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "t04", "id": 98941, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 16596, "offer": {"created_tick": 2208, "expires_tick": 2216, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 89, "types": []}, "id": 25596, "maker": "t04", "status": "open", "thread": 3255, "to": "picaros", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:MAL-11"]}}, "sender": "t04", "team": "t04", "text": null, "thread": 3255, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.8083, "tick": 2208, "type": "thread.message"}
