{"actor": "t08", "id": 98981, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 16605, "offer": {"created_tick": 2209, "expires_tick": 2217, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 41, "types": []}, "id": 25603, "maker": "t08", "status": "open", "thread": 3236, "to": "picaros", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:LAT-10"]}}, "sender": "t08", "team": "t08", "text": null, "thread": 3236, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.8125, "tick": 2209, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "banco", "id": 98985, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 16607, "offer": {"created_tick": 2210, "expires_tick": 2218, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:MAL-12"]}, "id": 25605, "maker": "banco", "status": "open", "thread": 3249, "to": "t12", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 753, "types": []}}, "sender": "banco", "team": "t12", "text": "Un peso again. You count pesos; I count years. La Reina de la Movida: 753. She rests well in the dark, señor. Bring a number worth the walk.", "thread": 3249, "with": "banco"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.8167, "tick": 2210, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "picaros", "id": 98988, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 16608, "offer": {"created_tick": 2210, "expires_tick": 2218, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:MAL-11"]}, "id": 25606, "maker": "picaros", "status": "open", "thread": 3255, "to": "t04", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 155, "types": []}}, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t04", "text": "¡Primo, el ánimo cura más que la medicina, eso lo dice hasta nuestra madre con la tele puesta! Por tu hermano y por ese doctor: 155 P la Pentagrama. Mírala, brilla como salón lleno. Paco ya la está envolviendo, Nando ya cierra el maletín. ¿Cerramos, primo? Que se nos va.", "thread": 3255, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 16.8167, "tick": 2210, "type": "thread.message"}
